    <item>
      <title>Contact</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/pages/contact/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
       <guid isPermaLink="false">http://localhost:1313/pages/contact/</guid> 
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;contact&#34;&gt;Contact&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Call Us!&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&#34;tel:310-584-7827&#34;&gt;310-584-7827&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have something you want to say? Send it here!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;form class=&#34;contact-form&#34; action=&#34;https://formspree.io/f/your-form-id&#34; method=&#34;POST&#34;&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;
    &lt;label for=&#34;name&#34;&gt;Name&lt;/label&gt;
    &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;name&#34; name=&#34;name&#34; required&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;
    &lt;label for=&#34;email&#34;&gt;Email&lt;/label&gt;
    &lt;input type=&#34;email&#34; id=&#34;email&#34; name=&#34;email&#34; required&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;
    &lt;label for=&#34;website&#34;&gt;Website&lt;/label&gt;
    &lt;input type=&#34;url&#34; id=&#34;website&#34; name=&#34;website&#34;&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;
    &lt;label for=&#34;message&#34;&gt;Comment&lt;/label&gt;
    &lt;textarea id=&#34;message&#34; name=&#34;message&#34; rows=&#34;5&#34; required&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;button type=&#34;submit&#34; class=&#34;submit-btn&#34;&gt;Send Message&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/form&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>The Hosts</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 25 Jan 2009 02:20:39 +0000</pubDate>
       <guid isPermaLink="false">https://tiptaptip.com/?page_id=2</guid> 
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eric&lt;/strong&gt; - Eric has been involved in a variety of different media before creating Tip Tap Tip. He was the co-editor of the popular Calgary-based magazine Squidmail with Joel Jackson during the 1990&amp;rsquo;s, and is also a co-host of &lt;a href=&#34;http://thesaladyears.wordpress.com/&#34;&gt;The Salad Years&lt;/a&gt;. Twitter - &lt;a href=&#34;http://twitter.com/ericskilling&#34;&gt;@ericskilling&lt;/a&gt; Mastodon - &lt;a href=&#34;https://mastodon.online/@ericskilling&#34;&gt;ericskilling@mastodon.online&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rachelle&lt;/strong&gt; - When she isn&amp;rsquo;t busting Eric&amp;rsquo;s balls on the show or encouraging him to don a leather daddy get-up, Rachelle is busy making art and taking care of raising their two young children. Rachelle&amp;rsquo;s art can be viewed on Instagram &lt;a href=&#34;https://instagram.com/artmom_artmom&#34;&gt;@artmom_artmom&lt;/a&gt; or her website &lt;a href=&#34;https://rachelleskillingart.wordpress.com/&#34;&gt;rachelleskilling.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
